        <item>
            <key> <string>description</string> </key>
            <value> <string>Install a Business Template that is not currently installed, from the shared\n
git working copy.\n
\n
RESOLVES the Business Template directory beneath the configured working-copy roots,\n
snapshots it (ERP5 reads the whole directory at download time into a fresh ZODB\n
Business Template), validates and builds it, then installs it in one transaction.\n
\n
FAILS with already_installed if the template is already installed, and suggests\n
erp5_bt_update_from_repository. Never silently turns an install into an update.\n
\n
Requires development permissions (Manager). All synchronous ZODB changes commit or\n
abort together with the surrounding request transaction.\n
\n
Returns JSON with: success, operation=\'install\', business_template, created,\n
revision, and a warning describing the transaction guarantee.\n
</string> </value>
